  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 807.02 Expiration of a Facility Permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 807.02 Expiration of a Facility Permit. A facility permit issued by the department shall expire 5 years from the date on which the permit became effective. This expiration date shall not be affected by any modifications, transfers, or waivers subsequently issued by the department for the permit.\n\nSource. #10998, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14571, eff 5-15-26, EXPIRES: 5-15-36",
